@startuml Sequence Diagram - Kelola Pasien
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram - Kelola Data Pasien DBD\nSistem Prediksi Penyebaran DBD

actor Admin
participant Browser
participant "Flask App\n(data.py)" as flask
participant "PasienDBD\nModel" as pasien
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as db

== Scenario 1: Melihat Daftar Pasien ==

Browser -> flask : 1.1: GET /data/
note left of flask : Note: Hanya Admin\nyang bisa akses
flask -> db : 1.2: SELECT * FROM pasien_dbd
db --> flask : 1.3: return list pasien
flask --> Browser : 1.4: Tampilkan tabel pasien

== Scenario 2: Tambah Data Pasien Baru ==

Admin -> Browser : 2.1: Klik 'Tambah Pasien'
flask -> pasien : 2.2: validate_pasien_data()
note left of flask : Note: Validasi\ndilakukan di form
pasien --> flask : 2.3: return is_valid
Browser -> flask : 2.4: Submit form (POST /data/create)
flask -> pasien : 2.5: INSERT INTO pasien_dbd
pasien -> db : 2.6: db.session.add() & commit()
db --> flask : 2.7: return success

== Scenario 3: Edit Data Pasien ==

Browser -> flask : 3.1: Submit edit (POST /data/edit/<id>)
flask -> pasien : 3.2: UPDATE pasien_dbd SET ...
pasien -> db : 3.3: db.session.commit()
db --> flask : 3.4: return success

== Scenario 4: Hapus Data Pasien ==

Browser -> flask : 4.1: Konfirmasi hapus (POST /data/delete/<id>)
flask -> pasien : 4.2: DELETE FROM pasien_dbd WHERE id=?
pasien --> Browser : 4.3: return success

@enduml
